Subject: [PATCH 3/5] igc.opencl.h: the Mach-O library names

The header tells the runtime (NEO) which file names to dlopen() for the
compiler. It had .dll and .so names only: on macOS the dylibs are
libigc.<major>.dylib and libigdfcl.<major>.dylib (the install names'
leaf, the SOVERSION symlinks the build makes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 IGC/AdaptorOCL/igc.opencl.h.in | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/IGC/AdaptorOCL/igc.opencl.h.in b/IGC/AdaptorOCL/igc.opencl.h.in
index e8fdcbedf..6633a918e 100644
--- a/IGC/AdaptorOCL/igc.opencl.h.in
+++ b/IGC/AdaptorOCL/igc.opencl.h.in
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@ SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
 #elif defined(ANDROID)
   #cmakedefine IGC_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${IGC_LIBRARY_NAME}.so"
   #cmakedefine FCL_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${FCL_LIBRARY_NAME}.so"
+#elif defined(__APPLE__)
+  // Mach-O: the install names' leaf (libigc.<major>.dylib), as dlopen() takes it
+  #cmakedefine IGC_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${IGC_LIBRARY_NAME}.${IGC_API_MAJOR_VERSION}.dylib"
+  #cmakedefine FCL_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${FCL_LIBRARY_NAME}.${IGC_API_MAJOR_VERSION}.dylib"
 #else
   #cmakedefine IGC_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${IGC_LIBRARY_NAME}.so.${IGC_API_MAJOR_VERSION}"
   #cmakedefine FCL_LIBRARY_NAME "lib${FCL_LIBRARY_NAME}.so.${IGC_API_MAJOR_VERSION}"
